# NOTE: This file is intentionally minimal.
# Sensitive Postiz env vars are NOT applied as a standalone Kubernetes Secret —
# they're rendered by the Helm chart itself from `secrets-overrides.yaml`.
#
# This file exists only for things that aren't covered by the chart's secrets block,
# in case you add custom integrations later (e.g. a sidecar that needs its own creds).
#
# For the standard install, you do NOT need to create or apply this file.
